---
---

<section class="scrim relative overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-32">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-8 flex justify-center">
      <span class="chip chip-danger">
        <span>&#9888;&#65039;</span> The Cost of Doing Nothing
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="reveal-text mb-6 text-h2 font-bold text-fg-1">
        Missed Calls Are Missed <span class="gradient-green-text">Money</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base text-fg-3 sm:text-lg">
        Every day without reliable call answering can mean missed revenue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div
        class="glass glass-regular grain reveal specular rounded-2xl p-8 transition-shadow duration-300 lift-hover"
      >
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip chip-danger">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-current"></span>
            High Risk
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="fomo-stat gradient-green-text mb-2 font-extrabold tracking-tight">62%</div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 text-fg-1">Unanswered Calls</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-3">
          Every missed ring is a customer buying from your competitor right now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="glass glass-regular grain reveal specular rounded-2xl p-8 transition-shadow duration-300 lift-hover"
      >
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip chip-warn">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-current"></span>
            Lead Leakage
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="fomo-stat gradient-green-text mb-2 font-extrabold tracking-tight">80%</div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 text-fg-1">Instant Lead Decay</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-3">
          Wait more than 5 minutes to reply, and the lead is already gone forever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="glass glass-regular grain reveal specular rounded-2xl p-8 transition-shadow duration-300 lift-hover"
      >
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="chip chip-danger">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-current"></span>
            Revenue Loss
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="fomo-stat gradient-green-text mb-2 font-extrabold tracking-tight">$8,000+</div>
        <h3 class="text-h3 text-fg-1">Lost Monthly Pipeline</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-3">
          On average, every business bleeds $8K+ a month by relying on voicemail.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
	/* Stat numbers: one size for all three, clamped so the widest figure
	   ($8,000+) fits the narrowest 3-up card (exactly 768px, ~160px of
	   content) with slack, without clipping. */
	.fomo-stat {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.35rem + 1.75vw, 3.25rem);
		line-height: 1;
	}
</style>
